{"seq":8,"slug":"industrial-robotics","title":"高等职业教育工业机器人技术","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":11,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/industrial-robotics","introMarkdown":"# 高等职业教育工业机器人技术\n\n我第一次站在一台正在码垛的六轴机器人旁边时，心里既兴奋又发怵：那条机械臂以肉眼几乎跟不上的速度抓取、转身、放下，节拍稳定得像钟表，却又随时可能因为一个示教点没标好而把工件甩飞。那一刻我意识到，工业机器人既不是科幻片里的\"智能生命\"，也不是一台普通的自动化设备，而是一套需要被人理解、被人驯服的精密系统。\n\n这个学习路线就是写给像当时的我那样、想从零摸进工业机器人这一行的人。我不打算把它讲成一门高深的力学课，而是按照\"看懂它—指挥它—用好它—修好它\"这条最朴素的实践链条，把整个领域拆成四块。\n\n第一块是结构与原理。我们会先弄清楚一台机器人到底由哪些部件组成，六轴、SCARA、Delta、协作机器人各自长什么样、擅长什么，再用尽量直观的方式理解关节坐标和笛卡尔坐标怎么换算，谐波减速器和 RV 减速器为什么是机器人的\"关节软肋\"。\n\n第二块是编程与示教。这是上手最快、也最让人有成就感的部分。我们从示教器开始，一个点一个点地教机器人走路，再过渡到在电脑里用 RobotStudio、RoboGuide 这类软件做离线编程和仿真，最后把运动指令、I/O 信号、逻辑判断串成一个完整的程序。\n\n第三块是系统集成与应用。真实工厂里，机器人从来不是单打独斗，它要和夹具、视觉、传送带、安全围栏一起组成一个工作站。我们会讨论怎么设计这样一个工作单元，安全该怎么做，以及焊接、搬运、装配这些典型应用各有什么门道。\n\n第四块是维护与故障诊断。机器人买回来只是开始，能长期稳定运行才是真本事。我们会聊日常保养该做什么、报警代码怎么看、机械和电气故障怎么一步步排查定位。\n\n到 2026 年，国产机器人在国内市场份额已经超过外资品牌，埃斯顿、汇川这些名字越来越常见，协作机器人也在 3C、新能源、食品等行业快速铺开。这意味着对会用、会修工业机器人的人来说，机会比以往任何时候都多。希望你学完这套内容后，再站到机械臂旁边时，看到的不再是一团神秘的钢铁，而是一套你能读懂、能调试、能信任的系统。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"robot-structure-principles","title":"机器人结构与工作原理","docCount":3,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/industrial-robotics/robot-structure-principles","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"robot-anatomy-and-types","title":"机器人的组成与常见类型","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/industrial-robotics/robot-structure-principles/robot-anatomy-and-types"},{"seq":2,"slug":"kinematics-and-coordinate-systems","title":"坐标系与运动学","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/industrial-robotics/robot-structure-principles/kinematics-and-coordinate-systems"},{"seq":3,"slug":"drive-and-transmission","title":"驱动与传动","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/industrial-robotics/robot-structure-principles/drive-and-transmission"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"programming-and-teaching","title":"编程与示教","docCount":3,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/industrial-robotics/programming-and-teaching","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"teach-pendant-basics","title":"示教器入门","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/industrial-robotics/programming-and-teaching/teach-pendant-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"offline-programming-and-simulation","title":"离线编程与仿真","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/industrial-robotics/programming-and-teaching/offline-programming-and-simulation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"motion-and-io-programming","title":"运动指令与 I/O 编程","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/industrial-robotics/programming-and-teaching/motion-and-io-programming"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"system-integration-application","title":"系统集成与应用","docCount":3,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/industrial-robotics/system-integration-application","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"workcell-design-and-safety","title":"工作站设计与安全","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/industrial-robotics/system-integration-application/workcell-design-and-safety"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vision-and-end-effectors","title":"机器视觉与末端执行器","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/industrial-robotics/system-integration-application/vision-and-end-effectors"},{"seq":3,"slug":"typical-applications","title":"典型应用场景","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/industrial-robotics/system-integration-application/typical-applications"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"maintenance-and-diagnostics","title":"维护与故障诊断","docCount":2,"url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/industrial-robotics/maintenance-and-diagnostics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"routine-maintenance","title":"日常维护与保养","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/industrial-robotics/maintenance-and-diagnostics/routine-maintenance"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fault-diagnosis-methods","title":"故障诊断方法","url":"/education/vocational/higher-vocational/industrial-robotics/maintenance-and-diagnostics/fault-diagnosis-methods"}]}]}